-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",325,{
[10369]="70034682\n1\tSteal the poison from barrels (total: 8)\tBarrels of poison, a favoured weapon of the Warg-riders, are stored around Edsig's Farm.\n2\tPoison raw meat (total: 4)\030Poison water bowls (total: 4)\tNew pups are being raised as Warg-mounts for riders in the back of Edsig's Farm. The Warg pups have supplies of meat and water that the Orcs placed for them. These would be effective places to put the poison you gathered.\n3\tCompleted\tThe poison has been placed, and the Orcs in Edsig's Farm will hopefully not realize the source of the problem for some time.\n",
[10370]="7000B3EA\n1\tTalk to Wald Sandson\tWald Sandson is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should return to Wald Sandson and report your success.\n",
[10371]="70062377\n1\tObtain information by defeating Uruks (total: 8)\tTham Celechir can be found north-east of Idhobel. Haerlendir has asked you to defeat Uruk-hai at Tham Celechir.\n2\tDefeat the Uruk-hai captain\tLook for an Uruk-hai captain within Tham Celechir.\n3\tObtain information from Uruk-hai\tThis parchment must have more information.\n4\tTalk to Haerlendir\tThe Uruk dropped a strange parchment. The markings are unfamiliar to you. Show the parchment to Haerlendir on the road south of Tham Celechir.\n5\tDeliver the parchment to Rhovandis at Idhobel\tHaerlendir asked you to show the strange parchment to Rhovandis in Idhobel. Return to Rhovandis.\n",
[10372]="7002C34E\n1\tSearch around the Nink-hai camp for evidence of the Uruk-hai's location\tThe Nink-hai Orc-tribe can be found south-west of Odda's tent. Odda has asked you to search among the Nink-hai tents for evidence leading to the location of the Uruk-hai.\n2\tDefeat Dargum, the White Hand emissary\tThe Uruk-hai, Dargum, may be found along the Limlight River to the south-east. You have discovered a note which reveals the name and location of the Uruk-hai emissary who has swayed the Nink-hai to ally with Isengard.\n3\tSearch Dargum's camp for something with which to bind him\tThe Uruk-hai may be bound with the rope on the ground near his tent. With Dargum defeated, he must be bound and escorted in custody to Stangard.\n",
[10373]="70016753\n1\tDefeat Blind-strider\tMazam-dûm lies upon the eastern shore of the lake in the Foundations of Stone. Nökkvi has asked you to return to the lair of the nameless creatures and defeat the greatest of their kind. Its death should serve as a decisive statement to the others.\n2\tTalk to Nökkvi at the Shadowed Refuge\tNökkvi is at the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone. You should return to Nökkvi and tell him of your victory against Blind-strider.\n",
[10374]="7002B6DC\n1\tDrink a beer to commiserate with the poor harangued drunkard\tThere seems to be a beer right in the hand of the drunkard. The drunkard encourages you to help yourself to some beer to commiserate with the woes of the drunkards of the Faire.\n2\tThrow rotten vegetables at the fun-spoiling Bounders (total: 10)\tBounders can be found throughout the Farmers Faire in Bywater. You should avoid the Bounders while drunk...and also take a little revenge upon them for being so hard on the folks who love to drink during festivals. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tReturn to the drunkard with news of your success against the Bounders\tNow that you have assailed the Bounders with a little sweet revenge, you should return to the drunkard. The drunkard is near the Green Dragon Inn in Bywater during the Farmers Faire.\n",
[10375]="7002F99D\n1\tIgnite powder kegs at the Nink-hai camp\tThe Nink-hai powder kegs can be found within their camp, east of Faldham.\n2\tIgnite powder kegs at the Nink-hai camp (total: 8)\tThe Nink-hai powder kegs can be found within the Orc camp east of Faldham. You plan to disrupt the Nink-hai plans by detonating their stores of dangerous powder kegs.\n3\tSpeak to Langfrith about the ignited powder kegs\tLangfrith can be found outside the meadhall of Faldham. Langfrith awaits the results of your actions with the Nink-hai powder kegs.\n",
[10376]="70029809\n1\tHelp Edhere and the slaves escape\tEdhere is in the Orc-mines. You should speak with Edhere when you are ready to lead the slaves through the mines in revolt.\n2\tTalk to Ondor the Dwarf\tYou should speak with Ondor the Dwarf regarding the escape from the Orc-mines.\n",
[10377]="700682A4\n1\tSpeak with Marjadi at Rakhatâb\tMarjadi wants to give you something for your nobility.\n",
[10378]="70052243\n1\tCalm the upset cat\030Calm the upset cow\030Calm the upset chicken\030Calm the upset horse\030Calm the upset pig\030Calm the upset sheep\030Calm the upset goat\tUpset animals can be found throughout the Vales of Anduin. You should calm upset animals.\n2\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[10379]="70052245\n1\tCalm the upset bird\030Calm the upset aurochs\030Calm the upset fox\030Calm the upset deer\030Calm the upset squirrel\030Calm the upset shrew\030Calm the upset rabbit\tUpset animals can be found throughout the Vales of Anduin. You should calm upset animals.\n2\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[10380]="7005223F\n1\tBring the refuse to Radagast\030Bring a rusty dagger to Radagast\030Bring a rusty mace to Radagast\030Bring a rusty sword to Radagast\030Bring a rusty axe to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should talk to Radagast. Refuse can be fished up in the Gladden Fields and under the Hadhodiant.\n",
[10381]="70052241\n1\tBring the refuse to Radagast\030Bring a ball of gunk to Radagast\030Bring an old boot to Radagast\030Bring an old glove to Radagast\030Bring a rusty hammer to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should talk to Radagast. Refuse can be fished up in the Gladden Fields and under the Hadhodiant.\n",
[10382]="7005224A\n1\tGather broccoli (total: 4)\030Gather cabbage (total: 6)\030Gather rhubarb (total: 2)\030Gather strawberries (total: 8)\tRadagast's garden can be found in Rhosgobel near Radagast's Cottage. You should gather fruits and vegetables from Radagast's garden.\n2\tPut the vegetables in the empty basket outside of Radagast's cottage\tAn empty basket can be found just outside Radagast's Cottage. You should deposit the vegetables that you have collected into the empty basket.\n3\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[10383]="7005223D\n1\tCollect eggs (total: 12)\tChicken nests can be found in Rhosgobel. You should collect chicken eggs from nests in Rhosgobel.\n2\tPlace the eggs in the warming chest outside Radagast's cottage\tA warming chest can be found just outside Radagast's cottage in Rhosgobel. You should place the eggs that you have collected in the warming chest.\n3\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[10384]="700006BF\n1\tDeliver the satchels to Dannasen\030Collect the Rhudaran satchels (total: 10)\tThe Hillmen of Rhudaur are encamped in the north-east corner of Agamaur. Dannasen is at the Eglan-camp south-west of the Hillmen. Dannasen has asked you to bring him the satchels borne by the Hillmen of Rhudaur so that he might find evidence to remind his brethren in the south of the curse that binds them to Middle-earth.\n",
[10385]="70018C2E\n1\tGather boxes of ribbon (total: 5)\030Gather red berries (total: 5)\030Gather blue flowers (total: 5)\tThe boxes of ribbon can be found along the road leading north to Overhill. Red berries and blue flowers can be found in the woods north-east of the Party Tree. Daisy Boffin has asked you to gather up the missing boxes of ribbon and collect red berries and blue flowers to dye the ribbon with.\n2\tBring the gifts to Daisy Boffin\030Collect Blue Flower (total: 5)\030Collect Box of Ribbon (total: 5)\030Collect Red Berry (total: 5)\tDaisy Boffin is at the Party Tree. Daisy Boffin will be pleased to get the ribbons, berries, and flowers and begin work on the gifts for this year's Yule festival.\n",
[10386]="700300F4\n1\tCollect savings left behind in Langhold (total: 4)\tThe refugees' savings should be somewhere in the ruins of Langhold, as long as they haven't been taken by the enemy. You should search inside the homes of Langhold for any savings that may have survived the fires.\n2\tBring the coins to Cíllan at Harwick\tCíllan is waiting in the Refugee Camp outside Harwick. You should bring everything you collected to Cíllan.\n",
[10387]="70017525\n1\tDefeat cave-claws in Skûmfil (total: 16)\030Defeat the kergrim-summoner\tSkûmfil lies to the south-east of the Shadowed Refuge. Ymar told you that he was set to the task of ridding Skûmfil of the disease-carrying cave-claws within.\n2\tTalk to Ymar at the Shadowed Refuge\tYmar is at the Shadowed Refuge, north-west of Skûmfil. You found your way to Skûmfil and destroyed the cave-claws there, halting the spread of the disease that they carry.\n",
[10388]="70016BB3\n1\tThe solution to Twisttongue's riddle can likely be found somewhere in the Flaming Deeps. You have found another of Twisttongue's riddles: Weight in my belly, Trees are my back, Nails in my ribs, Feet do I lack.\t\n",
[10389]="70013700\n1\tBring the strange runes to Sót at the Dolven-view\tSót, the librarian of the Dolven-view camp, might know more about the papers you found. You should speak with him.\n",
[10390]="70013701\n1\tSolve Twisttongue's riddle by choosing the correct chest: At night, I come without being fetched. By day, though lost, I am not gone. All know me, but only the ocean heeds my call. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n2\tTalk to Öndótt about the key you found\tÖndótt can be found in the Old Silvertine City in the Silvertine Lodes. You should tell Öndótt that you solved an ancient riddle and uncovered a key.\n",
[10391]="70016D0C\n1\tFind the answer to Twisttongue's last riddle\tSolve the last of Twisttongue's riddles to find the treasure: A room in shadows with no door No wood or tile make up my floor Nature's art my columns carved In my belly bears have starved Step far down and water face Right foot follow and road trace Sunsetward and great rocks paired: Twisttongue for his family cared.\n2\tCollect your reward from the chest\tYour reward lies within the chest in Falgeirr's cave.\n",
[10392]="70016D0D\n1\tSolve Falgeirr's riddle: Dwarf walketh over, Dwarf walketh under. In time of war, Dwarf burneth asunder. Ulfkell believes that the answer to Falgeirr's riddle lies somewhere within the great Chamber of Records, known also as the Chamber of Mazarbul.\t\n",
[10393]="70016BB4\n1\tPull the lever that matches the correct plaque to answer Twisttongue's riddle\tFalgeirr Twisttongue's latest riddle reads: I turn around once, What is out will not get in. I turn around again, What is in will not get out. Select the lever that best answers this riddle. The levers are in Bhraf-ru in the Flaming Deeps. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Endrith in Anazârmekhem\tEndrith is at Anazârmekhem in the Flaming Deeps. You should tell Endrith of your strange discoveries.\n",
[10394]="700375BE\n1\tBring Baldmund's advice to Reeve Fríthild\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Baldmund asked you to bring his advice to Reeve Fríthild in the hopes that she will see the wisdom of the plan and not be biased by his lowly station.\n2\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should speak with Reeve Fríthild regarding the recent battle against the Warg-riders.\n",
[10395]="70034AC0\n1\tFind people of Wildermore in the north-eastern Writhendowns\tA camp of Wildermore's folk can likely be found near the northern border of the Wold and the Writhendowns. You should ride to the north, and then turn west to cross the border into Wildermore.\n2\tSpeak with Thrymm Red-beard\tThrymm Red-beard is at his camp in the northern Writhendowns. You should speak with Thrymm Red-beard at his camp.\n",
[10396]="700375D9\n1\tDefeat brigand captain\030Defeat brigands (total: 3)\tGrimlac's allies might be found somewhere outside the north-east gate. Thane Ordlac asked you to ride out against Grimlac's companions.\n2\tBring the token to Thane Ordlac\tThane Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should bring the token you discovered to Thane Ordlac.\n3\tTalk to Lúfa\tLúfa is at Stoke's north-east gate. You should speak at once with Lúfa.\n",
[10397]="7002EE16\n1\tTalk to Céolbald\tA band of Rohirrim from the Wold have made camp in the East Wall south-west of the Argonath and the entrance to the Wold, in the stretch of land that leads to the Norcrofts. You have been told where to find a camp of the Rohirrim in the East Wall, and should seek them out to offer your aid against the Orcs.\n2\tInteract with Injured Rohirrim Archer\030Interact with Injured Rohirrim Spearman\030Interact with Injured Rohirrim Provisioner\tRohirrim injured in the recent battle with the Orcs need your help to be made more comfortable. Wounded Rohirrim can be found throughout their camp.\n3\tTalk to Céolbald\tCéolbald can be found within the Rohirrim camp in the East Wall, in the swath of land that leads to the Norcrofts. You have seen to the comfort of several injured Rohirrim, and should return to Céolbald.\n",
[10398]="700169C9\n1\tDefeat Moria riders (total: 6)\tMoria riders can be found at Athmadhul, south-east of Mekhem-bizru. Ótam wants you to defeat the goblins training to become new Warg-riders.\n2\tTalk to Ótam at Mekhem-bizru\tÓtam is at Mekhem-bizru, north-west of Athmadhul. Ótam will be pleased to hear the goblin Warg-riders have been defeated.\n",
[10399]="70062118\n1\tSearch for Saeloril\tBurl Stonecrop has asked you locate his missing scout Saeloril, near Nímbarth. Nímbarth is located in south-east Cardolan.\n2\tCollect orders from riders\tSaeloril has asked you to defeat riders from Nímbarth and bring back the orders they are carrying. Riders can be found in Nímbarth.\n3\tReturn to Saeloril\tYou have recovered orders destined for Tharbad from the riders of Nímbarth! You should bring the orders they were carrying to Saeloril. Saeloril is near Nímbarth, in southern Cardolan.\n",
[10400]="70045548\n1\tDeliver the burnt ears to a collection box\030Collect burnt ears (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire burnt ears.\n",
})
